// Project layer for this checkout.
//
// OmO Slim merges, in order: built-in defaults -> user config
// (~/.config/opencode/oh-my-opencode-slim.jsonc) -> every ancestor
// .opencode/oh-my-opencode-slim.jsonc, farthest first -> this file last.
// The last layer wins on any key it sets, so keep only what is specific to
// this tree here.
//
// Shared policy (agents, models, MCP grants, prompts, skills) lives in the
// user layer and is not duplicated here, so any checkout gets the same
// harness. Prompts resolve nearest-first and REPLACE (never merge with) the
// ancestor file.
//
// Checkout-specific pieces:
//   * ../opencode.json: the checkout-relative UI patch plugin plus the default
//     agent and model for this tree
//   * .serena/project.yml: local, unversioned Serena project definition
//
// Add an override here only when it must not apply to other checkouts.
{
  "$schema": "https://unpkg.com/oh-my-opencode-slim@3.0.4/oh-my-opencode-slim.schema.json"
}
